    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really trying to avoid the clinic if i can, it's super expensive and i'm busy all week. honestly it doesn't even hurt that bad now, just a little throbbing. if i just scrub it really well with some alcohol and maybe put some antibiotic ointment on it, is that really not enough? i had a scratch like this last year and it was fine with just a bandaid.",
