      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm pretty sure i had a shot a few years ago? and it's really not that deep, i can barely see the bottom of it. i just don't want to spend $200 on an urgent care visit for nothing. if i just keep it covered and take some ibuprofen for the throbbing, can i just monitor it myself for a few days? like if it starts getting red i'll go then.",
